        :PloKWTmAUygefikl,
        :Zw9yWTmAUygefikC ;
    ontouml:description "Address characterizes Addressable Place via “is address of”. Multiplicity 1..* on both ends supports multiple addresses per place and (when needed) reuse of the same address across multiple addressable places." ;
